{"translation":{"id":"kan_okcv","name":"Biblica® ಉಚಿತ ಕನ್ನಡ ಸಮಕಾಲಿಕ ಭಾಷಾಂತರ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanokcv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanokcv","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"OKCV","englishName":"Kanada Open Contemporary Version Bible","language":"kan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"579eda1a2f0787e978bfdd1e238e1f22be5be659c98add6930ad2d796778f705","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31090,"languageName":"ಕನ್ನಡ","languageEnglishName":"Kannada"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"kan_okcv","name":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","commonName":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","title":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8fda6557d2590d4e512d2801111ece4ef0438ce426c3b9b41fc862a02e5e2271","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":114,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ಇಸ್ರಾಯೇಲರು ಈಜಿಪ್ಟಿನೊಳಗಿಂದಲೂ,","poem":1},{"text":"ಯಾಕೋಬನ ಮನೆತನವು ಅನ್ಯಭಾಷೆಯುಳ್ಳ ಜನರೊಳಗಿಂದಲೂ ಹೊರಟುಬಂದಾಗ,","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"ಯೆಹೂದವು ದೇವರ ಪರಿಶುದ್ಧ ಸ್ಥಳವಾಯಿತು,","poem":1},{"text":"ಇಸ್ರಾಯೇಲು ದೇವರ ರಾಜ್ಯವಾಯಿತು.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"ಸಮುದ್ರವು ನೋಡಿ ಓಡಿಹೋಯಿತು;","poem":1},{"text":"ಯೊರ್ದನ್ ನದಿ ಹಿಂದಿರುಗಿತು.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"ಬೆಟ್ಟಗಳು ಟಗರುಗಳಂತೆ ಓಡಿತು,","poem":1},{"text":"ಗುಡ್ಡಗಳು ಕುರಿಮರಿಗಳಂತೆಯೂ ಓಡಾಡಿದವು.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"ಸಮುದ್ರವೇ, ನಿನಗೆ ಏನಾಯಿತು? ಏಕೆ ಓಡಿ ಹೋಗುತ್ತೀ?","poem":1},{"text":"ಯೊರ್ದನ್ ನದಿಯೇ, ಏಕೆ ಹಿಂದಿರುಗುತ್ತೀ?","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"ಬೆಟ್ಟಗಳೇ, ಟಗರುಗಳ ಹಾಗೆಯೂ; ಚಿಕ್ಕಗುಡ್ಡಗಳೇ,","poem":1},{"text":"ನೀವು ಕುರಿಮರಿಗಳ ಹಾಗೆಯೂ ಹಾರಾಡುವುದೇಕೆ?","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವ ದೇವರ ಸನ್ನಿಧಿಯಲ್ಲಿಯೂ,","poem":1},{"text":"ಯಾಕೋಬಿನ ದೇವರ ಮುಂದೆಯೂ ಭೂಮಿಯೇ ನಡುಗು.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"ದೇವರು ಬಂಡೆಯನ್ನು ನೀರಿನ ಕೆರೆಯಾಗಿಯೂ,","poem":1},{"text":"ಕಗ್ಗಲ್ಲನ್ನು ನೀರಿನ ಬುಗ್ಗೆಯಾಗಿ ಮಾರ್ಪಡಿಸುತ್ತಾರೆ.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/114.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/115.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/113.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}